  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nexus Initiative on Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights Phase 2 (2022-2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Objective of the Nexus Initiative is to help drive more progressive norm-setting on SRHR in UN fora and in doing so, build global momentum and pressure to advance SRHR outcomes around the world. It encourages governments to strengthen their commitment to, and increase the effectiveness of, their support to SRHR in UN fora. The primary outcomes of the Nexus Initiative are i) that UN normsetting on SRHR in New York and Geneva is more progressive, and ii) that a wider range of governments from all regions are consistently supportive of progressive SRHR language in UN forums, and fewer are opposed. 

Nexus has a secretariat supported by likemeinded SRHR countries and provide coordination among national states in the UN space.</narrative>
  </description>
